.claude/

# Agent screenshots are a BUILD ARTIFACT, not published content. They are how
# an agent shows its work in a report; they are not the game. Two of them were
# the ENDING CARD - the whole closing text plus the town-name reveal - sitting
# browsable in a public repo, which is the exact thing the embargo protects.
# Anything the devlog actually needs gets harvested into devlog/img/ and
# committed deliberately.
shots/
.measure/
tools/neuro/receipts/cit-data.json
design/cs35-research/kube-runs/

# the iOS app is GENERATED: ios/www is a copy of the game (55MB of it is
# the music), the .xcodeproj comes from ios/project.yml, and Info.plist comes
# from the same spec. tools/mkios.mjs rebuilds all three.
ios/www/
ios/*.xcodeproj/
ios/Resources/Info.plist

# the Apple Developer team, so a regeneration does not need the env var.
# Local because it is account-specific, not because it is secret.
ios/team.local
